cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fastsim: NovaSeq-like paired-end read simulator with exact ground truth"
abstract: "Generates synthetic NovaSeq-like sequencing reads with artefact CDFs, per-position quality curves, adapter readthrough, PCR duplicates and a must-drop class, driven by a profile measured from real data or fitted by fastcheck — the ground truth that makes trimming benchmarks exact."
